'''Bucaspor''' was a professional Turkish [[Association football|football]] club based in [[Buca]], [[İzmir]]. Formed in 1928, Bucaspor were nicknamed '''Fırtına''' (Storm). The club colours were yellow and navy.<ref name=tarihce /> It was dissolved in 2020."}}
